Package: proviz
Title: Process Mining Analysis and Authoring Tools
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Frenk", "Giorgetti", email = "frenk.giorgetti@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Turns a telemetry recorder's event logs into bupaR eventlogs
    and process-mining reports, against a registry of business processes,
    apps, and their declared step diagrams (a graph, not an enumerated
    list of variants -- cycles are just back-edges). Provides authoring
    aids for instrumenting a new Shiny application, starting with a
    static-analysis scanner that inventories an app's inputs, observers,
    and UI widgets as candidate hook points for a human to map onto a
    step, and a companion registry editor app for that mapping workflow.
